<title>UK: London gold fixed at $338.95, 11-week low.</title>
<headline>London gold fixed at $338.95, 11-week low.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold slipped to its lowest fixing since February 12 this year on Tuesday when it was fixed at $338.95 per ounce.</p>
<p>On Monday afternoon bullion fixed at $340.20.</p>
</text>
